<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Amago Yoshihisa</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">1540–1610</span> · <a href="/centuries/16th-century">16th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Amago Yoshihisa was the last head of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/amago-clan">Amago clan</a> of Izumo. After a long siege of Gassan-Toda castle by Mōri Motonari, he surrendered in 1566, ending the Amago as a ruling house. He spent the rest of his life as a retainer of the Mōri, while his former <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/vassal">vassals</a> tried in vain to restore the clan.</p></div>
